/1f09/dada/613744_mini.png?m=1787274415", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1f09/dada/613744_normal.png?m=1787274415", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1f09/dada/613744_large.png?m=1787274415", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1f09/dada/613744_xlarge.png?m=1787274415", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1f09/dada/613744_xxlarge.png?m=1787274415", "created": 1676221748, "last_modified": 1787274415, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "v1", "last_touched": 1787315406, "title": "毕业跟大学老师干了 3 年，欠薪 4 个月还在温水煮青蛙，纠结要不要跑路", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236035", "created": 1787274737, "deleted": 0, "content": "# 毕业跟大学老师干了 3 年，欠薪 4 个月还在温水煮青蛙，纠结要不要跑路\r\n\r\n23 年本科毕业就跟着大学老师干了，进了他开的小外包公司，我是第一个员工。一晃干了 3 年多，现在公司 5 个正式员工，剩下都是在校实习生。\r\n\r\n刚来那阵子待遇挺好的，年终奖 2 个月，还有每月孝顺金、4 天半工作制。后来大环境不行福利慢慢砍了，也就年终奖还在，我也没说啥，觉得能按时发工资就行。\r\n\r\n但现在情况越来越不对劲，项目回款卡死，已经停发了 4 个月工资，去年年终奖也只给了一半。老板口头说下周能发点，但我估计最多先发一两个月的，剩下的等后面回款再说。其实看他也挺不容易的，我现在在上海驻场，房租是他个人垫付的，垫了好几万，他人确实还不错。\r\n\r\n照理说欠薪 4 个月早该跑了，但我现在心态特纠结：\r\n\r\n* **温水煮青蛙太舒服了**：在上海包住包一顿午饭，周末双休。我名义上是全栈组长，平时也只是把需求拆一拆分给其它开发和实习生做，自己平时很少写代码了。白天大部分时间在摸鱼、盯盘看行情，日子过得太安逸，没有生存压力，根本不想跳出舒适圈，这个项目估计还能支撑一年。\r\n* **人情抹不开**：老板毕竟是大学老师，带我打拼了 3 年多，看他自己垫钱维持也挺不容易的，这时候提离职总觉得有点背叛他的负罪感。\r\n* **完全不会搞社招**：毕业后就没在外面面试过，而且简历我都不太会写。平时捣鼓 AI 和全栈比较多，但好久没深挖底层代码了，比较慌外面的八股和算法。\r\n\r\n一边知道这种安逸是假的（哪天撑不住断租断粮，我就得仓皇滚蛋），一边又被惰性和人情拖着。\r\n\r\n想问问老哥们：\r\n1. 这种被包吃住麻痹掉的虚假舒适圈，该怎么逼自己下狠心走出来？\r\n2. 离职怎么跟这种有师生情谊的老板开口比较体面？\r\n3. 程序员现在有没有什么靠谱好用的简历模板或网站推荐？ 3 年全栈第一次社招该怎么准备？\r\n\r\n求老哥们骂醒，多给点建议，感谢！", "content_rendered": "<h1>毕业跟大学老师干了 3 年，欠薪 4 个月还在温水煮青蛙，纠结要不要跑路</h1>\n<p>23 年本科毕业就跟着大学老师干了，进了他开的小外包公司，我是第一个员工。一晃干了 3 年多，现在公司 5 个正式员工，剩下都是在校实习生。</p>\n<p>刚来那阵子待遇挺好的，年终奖 2 个月，还有每月孝顺金、4 天半工作制。后来大环境不行福利慢慢砍了，也就年终奖还在，我也没说啥，觉得能按时发工资就行。</p>\n<p>但现在情况越来越不对劲，项目回款卡死，已经停发了 4 个月工资，去年年终奖也只给了一半。老板口头说下周能发点，但我估计最多先发一两个月的，剩下的等后面回款再说。其实看他也挺不容易的，我现在在上海驻场，房租是他个人垫付的，垫了好几万，他人确实还不错。</p>\n<p>照理说欠薪 4 个月早该跑了，但我现在心态特纠结：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>温水煮青蛙太舒服了</strong>：在上海包住包一顿午饭，周末双休。我名义上是全栈组长，平时也只是把需求拆一拆分给其它开发和实习生做，自己平时很少写代码了。白天大部分时间在摸鱼、盯盘看行情，日子过得太安逸，没有生存压力，根本不想跳出舒适圈，这个项目估计还能支撑一年。</li>\n<li><strong>人情抹不开</strong>：老板毕竟是大学老师，带我打拼了 3 年多，看他自己垫钱维持也挺不容易的，这时候提离职总觉得有点背叛他的负罪感。</li>\n<li><strong>完全不会搞社招</strong>：毕业后就没在外面面试过，而且简历我都不太会写。平时捣鼓 AI 和全栈比较多，但好久没深挖底层代码了，比较慌外面的八股和算法。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一边知道这种安逸是假的（哪天撑不住断租断粮，我就得仓皇滚蛋），一边又被惰性和人情拖着。</p>\n<p>想问问老哥们：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>这种被包吃住麻痹掉的虚假舒适圈，该怎么逼自己下狠心走出来？</li>\n<li>离职怎么跟这种有师生情谊的老板开口比较体面？</li>\n<li>程序员现在有没有什么靠谱好用的简历模板或网站推荐？ 3 年全栈第一次社招该怎么准备？</li>\n</ol>\n<p>求老哥们骂醒，多给点建议，感谢！</p>\n", "last_modified": 1787274918, "replies": 87, "id": 1236035}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 72874, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9763, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 769813, "username": "guanxue", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/guanxue", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/55a5/5aa6/769813_mini.png?m=1784598662", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/55a5/5aa6/769813_normal.png?m=1784598662", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/55a5/5aa6/769813_large.png?m=1784598662", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/55a5/5aa6/769813_xlarge.png?m=1784598662", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/55a5/5aa6/769813_xxlarge.png?m=1784598662", "created": 1760103541, "last_modified": 1784598662, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "kev192", "last_touched": 1787336062, "title": "请教下各位用的都是什么梯子订阅", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236097", "created": 1787281444, "deleted": 0, "content": "现在 AI 火爆，随之而来就是对梯子稳定/延迟的考验，目前已经试过闪电/大机场/冲浪猫/Bocchi/追云，其中闪电和大机场年订阅 260 ，延迟略高但平稳，稳定一般（一天内会偶现 Timeout ）;冲浪猫/Bocchi 可以按流量/年订阅选择，价格一百左右够用，延迟略低但波动，稳定略强（两三天会偶现 Timeout ）;追云是便宜延迟低但稳定较差（一天内可能几次 Timeout ）。\r\n\r\n想了解下各位的梯子用的哪些，可以分享带邀请码的，简单说明下价格/延迟/波动等情况，以及设备限制/速率等。", "content_rendered": "<p>现在 AI 火爆，随之而来就是对梯子稳定/延迟的考验，目前已经试过闪电/大机场/冲浪猫/Bocchi/追云，其中闪电和大机场年订阅 260 ，延迟略高但平稳，稳定一般（一天内会偶现 Timeout ）;冲浪猫/Bocchi 可以按流量/年订阅选择，价格一百左右够用，延迟略低但波动，稳定略强（两三天会偶现 Timeout ）;追云是便宜延迟低但稳定较差（一天内可能几次 Timeout ）。</p>\n<p>想了解下各位的梯子用的哪些，可以分享带邀请码的，简单说明下价格/延迟/波动等情况，以及设备限制/速率等。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1787281444, "replies": 87, "id": 1236097}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 72874, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9763, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 499495, "username": "Ayanokouji", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/Ayanokouji", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9075/dfdb/499495_mini.png?m=1773811031", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9075/dfdb/499495_normal.png?m=1773811031", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9075/dfdb/499495_large.png?m=1773811031", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9075/dfdb/499495_xlarge.png?m=1773811031", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9075/dfdb/499495_xxlarge.png?m=1773811031", "created": 1594909971, "last_modified": 1773811031, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "yulon", "last_touched": 1787335361, "title": "你们会骂 AI 吗", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236083", "created": 1787279527, "deleted": 0, "content": "遇到需求理解错误跑偏，牛头不对马嘴的时候，我都是重开一个回话，重新整理提示词。和 AI 对骂又解决不了问题。", "content_rendered": "遇到需求理解错误跑偏，牛头不对马嘴的时候，我都是重开一个回话，重新整理提示词。和 AI 对骂又解决不了问题。", "last_modified": 1787279527, "replies": 85, "id": 1236083}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_large.png?m=1751736785", "name": "openai", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_normal.png?m=1751736785", "title": "OpenAI", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai", "topics": 4544, "footer": "", "header": "关于 OpenAI 旗下产品 GPT，DALL·E，和 ChatGPT 的讨论。请不要在 V2EX 的回复中粘贴复制来自 AI 生成的文本。", "title_alternative": "OpenAI", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785", "stars": 3300, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1135, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 477906, "username": "lgc931018", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/lgc931018", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a326/0df4/477906_mini.png?m=1787193962", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a326/0df4/477906_normal.png?m=1787193962", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a326/0df4/477906_large.png?m=1787193962", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a326/0df4/477906_xlarge.png?m=1787193962", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a326/0df4/477906_xxlarge.png?m=1787193962", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a326/0df4/477906_xxxlarge.png?m=1787193962", "created": 1584718940, "last_modified": 1787193962, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "royzxq", "last_touched": 1787320012, "title": "刚刚看到 Tibo 说 Codex 额度用的太快是 sub2api 的问题", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236151", "created": 1787291148, "deleted": 0, "content": "不知道大家在用 sub2api 的是不是最近会有问题 \r\n我是两个 pro 20 反代了半年多 \r\n昨天重置前是出现了额度消耗很快 \r\n我还以为是我开了 fast 和最近没有 rest 的原因", "content_rendered": "<p>不知道大家在用 sub2api 的是不是最近会有问题\n我是两个 pro 20 反代了半年多\n昨天重置前是出现了额度消耗很快\n我还以为是我开了 fast 和最近没有 rest 的原因</p>\n", "last_modified": 1787291148, "replies": 74, "id": 1236151}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 11535, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2446, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 494209, "username": "CNN", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/CNN", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9d962325163a24e397ce6dac5d72dbf2?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9d962325163a24e397ce6dac5d72dbf2?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9d962325163a24e397ce6dac5d72dbf2?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1591791985, "last_modified": 1784855466, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "travelinglight", "last_touched": 1787329509, "title": "你的余额宝会放很多钱吗？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236027", "created": 1787270774, "deleted": 0, "content": "我看了下 4 万多每天收益 1 元", "content_rendered": "<p>我看了下 4 万多每天收益 1 元</p>\n", "last_modified": 1787270774, "replies": 67, "id": 1236027}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_large.png?m=1768280127", "name": "career", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_normal.png?m=1768280127", "title": "职场话题", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/career", "topics": 24142, "footer": "", "header": "这里，我们聊聊那些工作中遇到的开心和不开心的事。", "title_alternative": "Career", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_mini.png?m=1768280127", "stars": 3729, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 770, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 221751, "username": "tht1286545749", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/tht1286545749", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "前端 - 全栈 - agent - 项目管理", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11a3/7af8/221751_mini.png?m=1785396673", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11a3/7af8/221751_normal.png?m=1785396673", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11a3/7af8/221751_large.png?m=1785396673", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11a3/7af8/221751_xlarge.png?m=1785396673", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11a3/7af8/221751_xxlarge.png?m=1785396673", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11a3/7af8/221751_xxxlarge.png?m=1785396673", "created": 1489848211, "last_modified": 1785396673, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "pldxx", "last_touched": 1787328517, "title": "我们开始倒班考勤了", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236064", "created": 1787278088, "deleted": 0, "content": "没想到程序员也开始轮班了。\r\n\r\nAI 时代，倒班真的来了。\r\n\r\n由于智谱、DeepSeek 都实行高峰期 Token 翻倍策略，公司为了节约 Token 成本，本周起开始实行新考勤制度：\r\n\r\n非周末休息一天，周末再休息一天，可自由组合，但需要提前排班。\r\n\r\n与此同时，工作日作息也调整为 14:00 以后再午休。\r\n\r\nAI 不一定先抢走我的工作，\r\n但它已经开始决定我什么时候上班、什么时候休息了。\r\nAI 时代的一粒尘埃，落到了我的身上。", "content_rendered": "没想到程序员也开始轮班了。<br /><br />AI 时代，倒班真的来了。<br /><br />由于智谱、DeepSeek 都实行高峰期 Token 翻倍策略，公司为了节约 Token 成本，本周起开始实行新考勤制度：<br /><br />非周末休息一天，周末再休息一天，可自由组合，但需要提前排班。<br /><br />与此同时，工作日作息也调整为 14:00 以后再午休。<br /><br />AI 不一定先抢走我的工作，<br />但它已经开始决定我什么时候上班、什么时候休息了。<br />AI 时代的一粒尘埃，落到了我的身上。", "last_modified": 1787283934, "replies": 65, "id": 1236064}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 11535, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2446, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 479946, "username": "lucassss", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/lucassss", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/04c1/1a14/479946_mini.png?m=1770800356", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/04c1/1a14/479946_normal.png?m=1770800356", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/04c1/1a14/479946_large.png?m=1770800356", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/04c1/1a14/479946_xlarge.png?m=1770800356", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/04c1/1a14/479946_xxlarge.png?m=1770800356", "created": 1585551587, "last_modified": 1770800356, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "tc5156", "last_touched": 1787326025, "title": "半夜腰疼", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236047", "created": 1787275838, "deleted": 0, "content": "前两天每天睡醒之后腰很僵，动一下就疼，起来活动下就好了，今天直接半夜疼醒了，晚上起来站了 10 分钟才回去睡，白天上班倒是不怎么疼，有没有相似情况的老哥？", "content_rendered": "<p>前两天每天睡醒之后腰很僵，动一下就疼，起来活动下就好了，今天直接半夜疼醒了，晚上起来站了 10 分钟才回去睡，白天上班倒是不怎么疼，有没有相似情况的老哥？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1787275838, "replies": 56, "id": 1236047}]